OL,3,GNEWSASolar panels cut school bills by
OL,4,A#70,000 a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree East Yorkshire schools have
OL,7,Freduced their energy bills after
OL,8,Finstalling solar panels on their roofs.
OL,10,FWithernsea High School, Kingsway
OL,11,FPrimary and Marshlands Primary in Goole
OL,12,Fare expected to save a total of about
OL,13,F#71,000 a year and cut CO2 emissions by
OL,14,F75,000kg annually.
OL,16,FThe solar arrays were paid for by a
OL,17,F#218,000 grant from the Department for
OL,18,FEducation.
OL,20,FMark Crofts, headteacher at Withernsea
OL,21,FHigh School, said staff, pupils and
OL,22,Fparents had welcomed the upgrade.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
